idance — we are here to help.\",\"primaryText\":\"Contact Us\",\"primaryUrl\":\"/contact-us/#form\",\"secondaryText\":\"View Our Services\",\"secondaryUrl\":\"/services/\"} /-->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '22-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 15:06:59', '2026-06-16 15:06:59', '', '22', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=65', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('66', '0', '2026-06-16 15:18:35', '2026-06-16 15:18:35', '<!-- wp:hlm/hero {\"variant\":\"landing\",\"primaryCtaUrl\":\"#form\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"bar\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/universities /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/programs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/process {\"variant\":\"home\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/testimonials {\"description\":\"Institutions and students trust us to deliver results.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/blog /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"description\":\"Whether you are a student looking for the right program or an institution seeking qualified leads, we are here to help you succeed.\"} /-->', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 15:18:35', '2026-06-16 15:18:35', '', '12', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=66', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('67', '1', '2026-06-16 15:24:40', '2026-06-16 15:24:40', '<!-- wp:hlm/hero {\"variant\":\"light\",\"primaryCtaUrl\":\"#form\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"bar\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/universities /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/programs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/process {\"variant\":\"home\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/testimonials {\"description\":\"Institutions and students trust us to deliver results.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/blog /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"description\":\"Whether you are a student looking for the right program or an institution seeking qualified leads, we are here to help you succeed.\"} /-->', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 15:24:40', '2026-06-16 15:24:40', '', '12', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=67', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('68', '0', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '<!-- wp:hlm/hero {\"variant\":\"light\",\"primaryCtaUrl\":\"#form\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"bar\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/universities /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/programs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/process {\"variant\":\"home\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/testimonials {\"description\":\"Institutions and students trust us to deliver results.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/blog /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"description\":\"Whether you are a student looking for the right program or an institution seeking qualified leads, we are here to help you succeed.\"} /-->', 'Home', 'Connect with top universities and programs. Find your perfect educational path or partner with us to reach motivated students.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '', '12', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=68', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('69', '0', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '<!-- wp:hlm/page-hero {\"overline\":\"Our Story\",\"headline\":\"Bridging Ambition \\u0026amp; Opportunity\",\"description\":\"For over a decade, Higher Learning Marketers has been the trusted connection between motivated students and world-class educational institutions.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/partner-showcase {\"variant\":\"story\",\"imagePosition\":\"left\",\"overline\":\"Who We Are\",\"headline\":\"A Decade of Proven Results\",\"content\":\"Higher Learning Marketers was founded with a simple mission: eliminate the friction between students searching for the right educational path and the institutions ready to welcome them.nnWhat began as a small lead generation service has grown into a comprehensive education marketing platform. We now operate across 164 countries, partner with 560+ websites, and have generated over 10 million qualified leads for our partner institutions.nnOur team combines deep expertise in higher education marketing, data science, and student engagement to deliver results that matter — not just clicks, but enrollments.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=800\\u0026amp;h=600\\u0026amp;fit=crop\",\"imageAlt\":\"Higher Learning Marketers Team\",\"badge\":\"Trusted by 560+ Partner Websites\",\"stats\":[{\"number\":\"2014\",\"label\":\"Year Founded\"},{\"number\":\"50+\",\"label\":\"Team Members\"},{\"number\":\"164\",\"label\":\"Countries\"},{\"number\":\"98%\",\"label\":\"Satisfaction\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/why-us {\"variant\":\"values\",\"overline\":\"What Drives Us\",\"headline\":\"Our Core Values\",\"description\":\"Every decision we make is guided by principles that put students and partners first.\",\"pillars\":[{\"icon\":\"✓\",\"title\":\"Integrity First\",\"description\":\"We are TCPA and GDPR compliant. Every lead is verified, consented, and delivered with full transparency.\"},{\"icon\":\"◎\",\"title\":\"Quality Leads\",\"description\":\"We do not chase volume. Every student inquiry is pre-qualified and genuinely interested in advancing their education.\"},{\"icon\":\"🤝\",\"title\":\"Partnership\",\"description\":\"We work alongside universities as an extension of their admissions team, not just another vendor.\"},{\"icon\":\"⚡\",\"title\":\"Innovation\",\"description\":\"From AI-driven matching to real-time analytics, we constantly evolve our technology to stay ahead.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/timeline {\"variant\":\"light\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/team {\"variant\":\"cards\",\"overline\":\"The People\",\"headline\":\"Meet Our Leadership\",\"description\":\"Experienced professionals dedicated to transforming education marketing.\",\"members\":[{\"name\":\"James Richardson\",\"role\":\"Founder \\u0026amp; CEO\",\"bio\":\"Former admissions director turned entrepreneur. James founded HLM in 2014 after seeing firsthand how difficult it was for students to find the right programs.\",\"photoUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?w=600\\u0026amp;h=400\\u0026amp;fit=crop\\u0026amp;crop=face\"},{\"name\":\"Maria Santos\",\"role\":\"Chief Operating Officer\",\"bio\":\"15 years in higher ed operations. Maria oversees partner relationships and ensures every lead meets our rigorous quality standards.\",\"photoUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=600\\u0026amp;h=400\\u0026amp;fit=crop\\u0026amp;crop=face\"},{\"name\":\"David Chen\",\"role\":\"Chief Technology Officer\",\"bio\":\"Engineering leader with a background in ed-tech startups. David built the AI matching engine that powers our lead qualification system.\",\"photoUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=600\\u0026amp;h=400\\u0026amp;fit=crop\\u0026amp;crop=face\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"overline\":\"Work With Us\",\"headline\":\"Ready to Partner With HLM?\",\"description\":\"Whether you represent a university, a community organization, or a student seeking guidance — we are here to help.\",\"primaryText\":\"Contact Us\",\"primaryUrl\":\"/contact-us/#form\",\"secondaryText\":\"View Our Services\",\"secondaryUrl\":\"/services/\"} /-->', 'About Us', 'Meet the team behind Higher Learning Marketers. Over a decade of connecting students with top educational institutions.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '22-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '', '22', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=69', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('70', '0', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '<!-- wp:hlm/page-hero {\"overline\":\"What We Offer\",\"headline\":\"Enrollment Marketing That Delivers\",\"description\":\"From targeted lead generation to full-funnel enrollment campaigns, we provide the services universities need to connect with motivated students.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/services {\"overline\":\"Core Services\",\"headline\":\"Built for Higher Education\",\"description\":\"Every service is designed specifically for the unique challenges of recruiting and enrolling students in today\'s competitive landscape.\",\"services\":[{\"icon\":\"👥\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation\",\"description\":\"High-intent, pre-qualified student inquiries delivered directly to your admissions team. Every lead is verified and consented.\",\"tags\":\"TCPA Compliant, Real-time, Custom Filtering, Scalable\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"icon\":\"🌐\",\"title\":\"Brand Awareness\",\"description\":\"Multi-channel campaigns that put your institution in front of students actively researching their educational options.\",\"tags\":\"Display Ads, Landing Pages, Retargeting, Segmentation\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"icon\":\"📣\",\"title\":\"Multi-Channel Marketing\",\"description\":\"Integrated campaigns across search, social, email, and partner networks to maximize reach and enrollment conversions.\",\"tags\":\"SEO, Social, Email, PPC\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"icon\":\"📊\",\"title\":\"Analytics \\u0026amp; Reporting\",\"description\":\"Real-time dashboards and detailed reporting so you always know exactly how your campaigns are performing.\",\"tags\":\"Dashboards, Cost Tracking, Attribution, Reviews\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"icon\":\"🔗\",\"title\":\"Partner Network\",\"description\":\"Access to 560+ education-focused websites and platforms that reach students at every stage of their decision journey.\",\"tags\":\"560+ Sites, 164 Countries, Targeting, Exclusive\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"icon\":\"🎯\",\"title\":\"Enrollment Funnel\",\"description\":\"End-to-end funnel optimization from first impression to application submitted. We optimize every touchpoint for conversion.\",\"tags\":\"Landing Pages, A/B Testing, Forms, CRO\",\"link\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/process {\"variant\":\"strip\",\"overline\":\"How We Work\",\"headline\":\"Our 4-Step Process\",\"description\":\"A transparent process designed to deliver measurable results from day one.\",\"steps\":[{\"number\":\"01\",\"icon\":\"document\",\"title\":\"Discovery \\u0026amp; Strategy\",\"description\":\"We analyze your programs, target demographics, and enrollment goals to build a custom campaign strategy.\"},{\"number\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"info\",\"title\":\"Campaign Launch\",\"description\":\"Multi-channel campaigns go live across our partner network, search, social, and display platforms.\"},{\"number\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"check\",\"title\":\"Lead Delivery\",\"description\":\"Qualified leads flow directly to your CRM or admissions team in real-time, fully verified and consented.\"},{\"number\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"check\",\"title\":\"Optimize \\u0026amp; Scale\",\"description\":\"Weekly performance reviews and continuous optimization to improve quality and increase volume.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"network\",\"overline\":\"Proven Impact\",\"headline\":\"Results That Speak\",\"description\":\"Real outcomes from real partnerships across our network.\",\"stats\":[{\"number\":40,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"%\",\"label\":\"Avg. Increase in Qualified Leads\"},{\"number\":35,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"%\",\"label\":\"Lower Cost Per Enrollment\"},{\"number\":24,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"h\",\"label\":\"Average Lead Response Time\"},{\"number\":10,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"M+\",\"label\":\"Students Connected\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"overline\":\"Get Started\",\"headline\":\"Start Your Campaign Today\",\"description\":\"Talk to our team about which services fit your enrollment goals. No obligation, just honest advice.\",\"primaryText\":\"Request a Quote\",\"primaryUrl\":\"/contact-us/#form\",\"secondaryText\":\"Learn About Us\",\"secondaryUrl\":\"/about-us/\"} /-->', 'Services', 'Premium education lead generation services. From targeted campaigns to full-funnel enrollment marketing for universities and colleges.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '23-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=70', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('71', '0', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '<!-- wp:hlm/page-hero /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/partner-showcase /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/partners /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/affiliation /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"network\",\"stats\":[{\"number\":560,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Partner Websites\"},{\"number\":164,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\",\"label\":\"Countries Reached\"},{\"number\":10,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"M+\",\"label\":\"Leads Generated\"},{\"number\":6,\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\",\"label\":\"Core Partners\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"overline\":\"Become a Partner\",\"headline\":\"Join Our Network Today\",\"description\":\"Whether you are an educational institution, community organization, or technology platform — we would love to explore how we can work together.\",\"primaryText\":\"Partner With Us\",\"primaryUrl\":\"/contact-us/#form\",\"secondaryText\":\"Explore Services\",\"secondaryUrl\":\"/services/\"} /-->', 'Affiliations', 'Our strategic partnerships and affiliations. Higher Learning Marketers works with leading education organizations to connect students with opportunity.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '24-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '', '24', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=71', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('72', '0', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '<!-- wp:hlm/page-hero {\"overline\":\"Get In Touch\",\"headline\":\"Connect With Our Team\",\"description\":\"Whether you are a student seeking the right program, a university looking to expand your reach, or a Berkeley partner — we are ready to help.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/hero {\"overline\":\"\",\"headline\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"primaryCtaText\":\"\",\"secondaryCtaText\":\"\",\"trustHighlight\":\"\",\"trustText\":\"\",\"showLeadForm\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/contact {\"overline\":\"Office Details\",\"headline\":\"Other Ways to Reach Us\",\"email\":\"support@higherlearningmarketers.com\",\"phone\":\"+1 (718) 685-2575\",\"address\":\"138-07 82nd DrivenBriarwood, NY 11435\"} /-->', 'Contact Us', 'Get in touch with Higher Learning Marketers. Partner with us for qualified education leads or find the right program for your career goals.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '36-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '2026-06-16 20:37:22', '', '36', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=72', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
