('128', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our lead generation programs connect your admissions team with students who have already expressed interest in programs like yours. Every inquiry is verified, consent-based, and delivered in real time so your counselors can respond while intent is highest.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Custom audience targeting by program, geography, and degree level</li><li>TCPA-compliant consent capture on every lead</li><li>Real-time delivery to your CRM or admissions inbox</li><li>Quality filters and duplicate suppression</li><li>Weekly volume and conversion reporting</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ideal for universities and colleges that need predictable inquiry volume, faster counselor follow-up, and transparent lead quality-not just raw form fills.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Lead Generation', 'TCPA-compliant student lead generation for U.S. universities and colleges. Verified, consent-based inquiries delivered in real time to admissions teams.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'lead-generation', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/lead-generation/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('129', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Brand awareness campaigns keep your institution visible across the channels students use when they start exploring schools. We combine creative, media, and landing experiences so your programs stay top of mind before students are ready to apply.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Audience research and competitive positioning</li><li>Display, social, and retargeting creative</li><li>Program-specific landing pages</li><li>Geo and demographic segmentation</li><li>Reach, frequency, and engagement reporting</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Best for institutions launching new programs, entering new markets, or rebuilding visibility in competitive categories where name recognition drives inquiry quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Brand Awareness', 'Education brand awareness campaigns for U.S. universities and colleges. Multi-channel visibility across display, social, and retargeting.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'brand-awareness', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/brand-awareness/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('130', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Students rarely convert on a single touchpoint. Our multi-channel approach coordinates search, social, email, and partner placements so each interaction reinforces the next-and moves prospects closer to enrollment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Cross-channel campaign strategy and calendar</li><li>Paid search and social management</li><li>Email nurture sequences for inquiry follow-up</li><li>Partner network distribution</li><li>Unified reporting across channels</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Designed for enrollment teams that want one coordinated plan instead of disconnected vendors-and need clear attribution across the full student journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Multi-Channel Marketing', 'Integrated multi-channel enrollment marketing for U.S. universities. Search, social, email, and partner campaigns under one strategy.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'multi-channel-marketing', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/multi-channel-marketing/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('131', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '2026-06-17 08:18:06', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enrollment marketing only improves when you can see what is working. We provide dashboards and reporting cadences that tie spend, inquiries, and downstream enrollment outcomes back to the campaigns that drove them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Live performance dashboards</li><li>Cost-per-inquiry and cost-per-enrollment tracking</li><li>Source and channel attribution</li><li>Weekly optimization reviews with your team</li><li>Executive-ready summary reports</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Perfect for marketing and enrollment leaders who need transparent ROI, faster budget decisions, and a single source of truth for campaign performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Analytics & Reporting', 'Enrollment marketing analytics and reporting for U.S. universities. Track cost per lead, cost per enrollment, and campaign ROI in real time.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'analytics-reporting', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/analytics-reporting/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('132', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:07', '2026-06-17 08:18:07', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner network extends your reach beyond owned channels. We place your programs on education-focused sites where students compare schools, explore career paths, and request information from trusted sources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Placement across 560+ education properties</li><li>Program-level targeting and exclusivity options</li><li>International reach in 164 countries</li><li>Compliance review for every partner placement</li><li>Network-level performance reporting</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ideal when you need scale quickly, want incremental volume without increasing internal workload, or are expanding into new student segments and geographies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Partner Network', 'Education partner network with 560+ sites reaching U.S. students. Compliance-reviewed placements and consent-based lead generation.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'partner-network', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/partner-network/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('133', '1', '2026-06-17 08:18:07', '2026-06-17 08:18:07', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every step between first click and submitted application affects enrollment. We audit and optimize landing pages, forms, messaging, and follow-up sequences so more interested students complete the actions that matter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&apos;s Included</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Funnel audit across ads, landing pages, and forms</li><li>A/B testing on headlines, CTAs, and form fields</li><li>Mobile-first landing page improvements</li><li>Conversion rate optimization sprints</li><li>Before/after performance benchmarks</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who It&apos;s For</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Best for teams generating traffic but struggling to convert inquiries into applications-or anyone preparing for a peak enrollment season who needs higher conversion without increasing media spend.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Enrollment Funnel', 'Enrollment funnel optimization for U.S. universities. Landing page, form, and CRO improvements that raise inquiry-to-application rates.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'enrollment-funnel', '', '', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '2026-06-18 18:21:40', '', '23', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/services/enrollment-funnel/', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('134', '0', '2026-06-17 10:31:57', '2026-06-17 10:31:57', '<!-- wp:hlm/hero {\"variant\":\"light\",\"overline\":\"Education Lead Generation\",\"headline\":\"Connect Universities With Motivated U.S. Students\",\"description\":\"Higher Learning Marketers is a U.S.-focused education lead generation platform — helping universities fill nursing, business, and career programs while guiding students to accredited institutions that fit their goals.\",\"primaryCtaUrl\":\"#form\",\"secondaryCtaText\":\"University Services\",\"secondaryCtaUrl\":\"/services/\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/stats {\"variant\":\"bar\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/universities /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/programs /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/process {\"variant\":\"home\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/testimonials {\"description\":\"Institutions and students trust us to deliver results.\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/blog /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"description\":\"Whether you are a student looking for the right program or an institution seeking qualified leads, we are here to help you succeed.\"} /-->', 'Home', 'Connect with top universities and programs. Find your perfect educational path or partner with us to reach motivated students.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-17 10:31:57', '2026-06-17 10:31:57', '', '12', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=134', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
