.\"},{\"icon\":\"◎\",\"title\":\"Quality Leads\",\"description\":\"We do not chase volume. Every student inquiry is pre-qualified and genuinely interested in advancing their education.\"},{\"icon\":\"🤝\",\"title\":\"Partnership\",\"description\":\"We work alongside universities as an extension of their admissions team, not just another vendor.\"},{\"icon\":\"⚡\",\"title\":\"Innovation\",\"description\":\"From AI-driven matching to real-time analytics, we constantly evolve our technology to stay ahead.\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/timeline {\"variant\":\"light\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/team {\"variant\":\"cards\",\"overline\":\"The People\",\"headline\":\"Meet Our Leadership\",\"description\":\"Experienced professionals connecting U.S. students with accredited institutions through consent-based education marketing.\",\"members\":[{\"name\":\"Victor Daniel\",\"role\":\"President\",\"bio\":\"A veteran in online marketing and lead generation, Victor Daniel has spent decades connecting companies with consumers. He owns and operates an online portfolio of highly trafficked sites, sourcing cost-per-lead and cost-per-sale traffic from publishers and affiliates across 560 websites in 164 countries. A graduate of Stony Brook University, where he studied Business and Psychology, Victor has always been skilled at creating connections. Now focused on education-based data, he helps accredited institutions expand their reach among prospective students across the United States.\",\"photoUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?w=600\\u0026amp;h=400\\u0026amp;fit=crop\\u0026amp;crop=face\"},{\"name\":\"Robert Intelisano\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"bio\":\"A verified marketing leader, Robert Intelisano has kept his finger on the pulse of the college-bound community throughout his career. A graduate of Lehigh University with a bachelor\'s degree in Marketing, he has built winning branding strategies and outreach campaigns for prospective students. He is especially passionate about helping students understand merit-based financial aid opportunities so they can achieve their education goals. At Higher Learning Marketers, his expertise has helped streamline campaigns and maximize enrollment results for partner institutions.\",\"photoUrl\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=600\\u0026amp;h=400\\u0026amp;fit=crop\\u0026amp;crop=face\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:hlm/cta {\"overline\":\"Work With Us\",\"headline\":\"Ready to Partner With HLM?\",\"description\":\"Whether you represent a university, a community organization, or a student seeking guidance — we are here to help.\",\"primaryText\":\"Contact Us\",\"primaryUrl\":\"/contact-us/#form\",\"secondaryText\":\"View Our Services\",\"secondaryUrl\":\"/services/\"} /-->', 'About Us', 'Meet the team behind Higher Learning Marketers. Over a decade of connecting students with top educational institutions.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '22-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-17 10:47:09', '2026-06-17 10:47:09', '', '22', 'https://higherlearningmarketers.com/?p=140', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
